 "remarks": "Welcome to The Enclave on Willard, an intimate community of just 14 Nantucket-style townhomes ideally located near the Westport border. This desirable corner unit offers four levels of beautifully maintained living space and a rare connection to the outdoors.  The main level features a bright living room with gas fireplace and sliders to a private balcony, a spacious dining area, and a well-appointed kitchen with stainless steel appliances and designer quartz countertops. Upstairs are two bedrooms, including a primary suite with private full bath, while the spacious top-floor loft with skylights offers additional flexible living space.",
